# Compiling and Listings directories
Objects/
Listings/
_LinkerReport/

# Object files and dependencies
*.o
*.d
*.crf
*.bak
*.htm
*.dep
*.lnp
*.sct
*.lst
*.m51

# Target Build Outputs
*.axf
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
