# User-specific Keil settings (window layouts, breakpoints, etc.)
*.uvgui.*
*.uvguix.*
*.uv2.bak
*.pjt.bak

# ==========================================================================
# STM32CubeMX Configuration
# ==========================================================================
# Backup files generated during code re-generation
~*.tmp
*.bak

# NOTE: Do NOT ignore the *.ioc file! 
# It contains your CubeMX pinout and clock configuration (48MHz, Very High Speed).
# Other developers need it to understand your hardware setup.
#! *.ioc

